;    9: TDecorate(count=36, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=11271932, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=も, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=22, unk2=13464750, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=か, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   14: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=16777215, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   15: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=だま, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   16: TDecorate(count=11, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=48, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   17: TDecorate(count=5, unk2=5265653, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   18: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=にんげん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=6881, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=6284, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック2.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\荒田枯れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Think. Think! There has to be some condition...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The condition for the apocalyptic sound to ring out, and the condition for <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> to start moving.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> memo said, '<STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> has no intelligence.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> has no intelligence, then, like ordinary plants and fungi, she should grow and reproduce in response to nothing but the seasons and her surroundings.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But what about now?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "豊岳桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
She stopped us at Toyotake Station, gave <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> a strange premonition, and brought us here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is that something a being with no intelligence could do?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even granting, as the hypothesis goes, that <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> has the ability to hijack the five senses through <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Perceiving through the five senses alone shouldn't be enough to recognize, think, and act.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> has gained intelligence by some means.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\茅萱手紙.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
If I remember right, <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> memo said something about that too, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no guarantee that <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> memo is 'all accurate information,' but right now there's no better lead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, I have to build my guesses with <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> memo as the starting point after all.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\荒田枯れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, I saw someone come out of the Niimura house's front door.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had the apocalyptic sound startled the two of them into rushing out too?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When she saw me, <STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE> immediately looked up at the sky where the eerie sound had rung out.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... I hope she's okay... I sent her a message, but there's no reply... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I guess the signal really doesn't reach underground."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
―!!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Oh no...! <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> knows what <STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> is doing!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜死にかけ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\bgm_semarikuru.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"K-</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! You told her!? You talked about </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I grabbed <STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE> by both shoulders, shook her, and pressed her at the top of my voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Um... what about </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Did you tell her that </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> was going to the cave!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Y-yeah..."</STYLE><PG>
What a disaster...! Could the apocalyptic sound have rung out because of...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's my mistake for not telling <STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE> to keep quiet, but I never thought things would change this much faster than I'd imagined.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Giving <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> any more information is dangerous!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Um, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... what's wrong!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, please stay inside the house! And close your eyes, and cover your ears too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Uh, um..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I knew full well she wouldn't understand from an explanation like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But explaining it would mean giving <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> even more information.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Never mind that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, please just come, quickly!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸速い.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
I took <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE> hand by force and pulled her into the house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> still didn't seem to grasp the situation, but I couldn't worry about that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whatever happens, <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> has to be kept isolated the whole time.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま早く開ける.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "4" "500" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, listen!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Do NOT leave this room, <TXSPS>abso-lute-ly<TXSPN> not!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Um... what's this about...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I can't explain that! When you need the bathroom, call me!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Do not leave this room without me, ever!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Mm... o-okay..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, but right now this is the only way!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> probably wasn't truly convinced.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But since I'd said it this forcefully, <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> would surely see how important it was.<PG>
According to <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> research, the five senses can be hijacked but thoughts apparently can't, so as long as I give her no information, it should be all right.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not that I trust <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> research blindly...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Even so, I can't bear to keep <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> shut up in that room forever.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to act fast toward a solution myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I can do now is examine <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> memo and the books, deepen my hypothesis further, and reach the truth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE> found, I have to find as well.<PG>
Is <STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> all right?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Obasan</STYLE> is with her, so I think she's fine, but even if <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> sent a message, it'll be hard to reach them underground.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄ストラップ切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Just in case, I'll try calling.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"The number you have dialed is currently outside the service area―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No good after all...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A mummy probably isn't something you find right away, and if they've found a clue about <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, the search will take a good while longer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just in case, I'll send a message too.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="9">"A lot happened, so I told </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> to stay in her room alone. How are things on your end?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once she's back in range, <STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE> will probably send some kind of reply.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That is, if she hasn't run into danger...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Uh... uh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE> quietly appeared at the stairs.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Looking down, mumbling under her breath, fidgeting.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"I'm sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Probably because I'd suddenly gotten so angry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By rights, I should have told <STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE> to keep quiet too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is completely my mistake.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Code_of_Honor_#2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I'm the one who should be sorry. </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> didn't do anything wrong..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"But... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you were angry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hmm... grabbing her shoulders with a face like that probably went too far...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, rather than smoothing it over, it's better to turn her attention elsewhere.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Listen, that just now was really important. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">―if she's told what's going on right now, things will get really bad. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">So I panicked a little. I'm sorry too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"And also, I'd like </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> to help look for </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="5">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Good, she reacted to that, just as I thought.<PG>
