{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"G-got it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now that the fire might spread to the house, I couldn't keep <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> shut in her room any longer.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
People from all over the settlement gathered and tried to put out the storehouse fire.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> and I followed <STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE> and took refuge near the meeting hall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Little by little, the crimson burning the sky and the smoke grew fainter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed the fire was dying down.<PG>
